{"text": "One evening Keawe met a beautiful young woman named Kokua by the road, and before they parted, she agreed to marry him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Keawe rode home singing with joy, but that night, as he got ready for his bath, he saw a strange spot on his skin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was the Chinese Evil, a terrible sickness for which there was no cure in those days. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> People with this sickness had to leave their families and live apart on the island of Molokai. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I had not sold the bottle, I could have wished this sickness away, thought Keawe with a heavy heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was not the house but Kokua that he could not give up, so he decided to find the bottle again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He sailed to Honolulu, where he learned that Lopaka had sold it and that it had passed from hand to hand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last he found it with a young man in Beritania Street, who had paid only two cents for it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am sorry for you, said the young man, for one cent is the smallest coin, and you can never sell it again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Still, Keawe bought it for one cent, and the moment he made his wish, his skin became clean and healthy.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "K", "e", "a", "w", "e", " ", "m", "e", "t", " ", "a", " ", "b", "e", "a", "u", "t", "i", "f", "u", "l", " ", "y", "o", "u", "n", "g", " ", "w", "o", "m", "a", "n", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", "d", " ", "K", "o", "k", "u", "a", " ", "b", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "o", "a", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "b", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "p", "a", "r", "t", "e", "d", ",", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "a", "g", "r", "e", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "m", "a", "r", "r", "y", " ", "h", "i", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " "